@startuml
title System Context — DalaSu

left to right direction
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam defaultTextAlignment center

rectangle "«actor»\nFarmer / Agronomist" as Farmer #F5F5F5
rectangle "«actor»\nResearcher" as Researcher #F5F5F5

rectangle "DalaSu\nET estimation and irrigation\nrecommendation system" as DalaSu #E3F2FD

cloud "Environmental Data\nOpen-Meteo · Sentinel-2 · SoilGrids" as Environment
cloud "AmeriFlux US-Ne2\nvalidation data" as AmeriFlux
cloud "Push Provider" as Push

Farmer --> DalaSu : Field data and irrigation records
DalaSu --> Farmer : Recommendation and season view

Researcher --> DalaSu : Train and evaluate models
DalaSu --> Researcher : Metrics and explanations

Environment --> DalaSu : Weather, NDVI and soil data
AmeriFlux --> DalaSu : Meteorology and observed ET
DalaSu --> Push : Irrigation alert

note bottom of DalaSu
  Core scope: FR-01–FR-09
  Optional scope: FR-10–FR-14
  FR-15 is outside this release
end note

@enduml
